# Health Monitoring Report

## Health Endpoints
- `/actuator/health`
- `/actuator/info`
- `/actuator/prometheus`
- `/custom-health`

## Expected Health Status
The application should return `UP` when running successfully.

## Readiness and Liveness
Spring Boot actuator probes are enabled using:

```yaml
management:
  endpoint:
    health:
      probes:
        enabled: true
```

